nginx        web             1.30.6,3   catalog   valid     Web server and reverse proxy, serving /usr/local/www.
nsd          network         4.15       catalog   valid     Authoritative DNS server for your own zones, as a primary or a secondary.
postgresql   database        18.6       catalog   valid     Relational database server, PostgreSQL 18 from the FreeBSD packages.
valkey       database        9.1.2      catalog   valid     In-memory key-value store under the BSD license.

